# Torvus Bog 0d_swamp_hall_dark (3dfd2249,cbc72d79): CPuddleSpore e00150015.  Copied from
# tools/cov/specs/puddlespore.con for pud2 and given extra shots before the Delete, so
# CPuddleSpore::WeaponHitsWeakSpot is invoked several times by real player projectiles (its natural
# callers are Touch and GetCollisionResponseType).  The pud2 fixture turns ONE of those invocations
# into the open-vulnerability-rejects arm by writing a real CWeaponMode() value into the referenced
# mode for that call only.
@f300 god 1; give morphBall 1; give missile 50; fastmorph 1; objs Player
@f400 place e00150015 player 8
@f600 fsm e00150015 InActive
@f605 damage e00150015 1 1
@f650 touch e00150015 u0000
@f660 fsm e00150015 Attack
@f700 tp 150.69 -33.56 50
@f760 tp 150.69 -33.56 50; obj e00150015
@f800 fsm e00150015 Run
@f860 obj e00150015
@f900 fsm e00150015 TurnAround
@f1000 fsm e00150015 GetUp
@f1100 tp 150.69 -33.56 38.13
@f1200 tp 160 -33.56 38.3; press x 30
@f1500 tp 160 -33.56 40; press x 30
@f1560 fsm e00150015 Run
@f1570 beam 1
@f1580 shoot e00150015
@f1600 fsm e00150015 Run; beam 2
@f1610 shoot e00150015
@f1640 fsm e00150015 Run; beam 0
@f1650 shoot e00150015 1 dir 0 0.2 1
@f1680 fsm e00150015 Run
@f1690 shoot e00150015 missile
@f1700 fsm e00150015 Run
@f1710 shoot e00150015
@f1730 shoot e00150015 1
@f1750 shoot e00150015 missile
@f1770 obj e00150015
@f1800 send e00150015 Delete
@f1950 objs PuddleSpore
